x01-core-alignment patch 03-written-dt (git apply ignores this header)

E7 item: (c) Evolution interval and time. Only the written dT differs; the evolution interval and
substep time are already as SAGE26 (evidence in the report), so this patch changes output only.

SAGE26 behaviour: per galaxy and substep, in double, deltaT = Age[galaxies[p].SnapNum] - halo_age
(R/src/core_build_model.c:414, :479), and on the first substep dT = deltaT if dT < 0
(R/src/core_build_model.c:482-484), dT being a float member (R/src/core_allvars.h:123, reset to -1.0
at joining, R/src/core_build_model.c:237, and for a new galaxy, R/src/model_misc.c:105). The writer
stores g->dT * run_params->UnitTime_in_s / SEC_PER_MEGAYEAR, the float promoted to double and
evaluated left to right, into a float output buffer (R/src/io/save_gals_hdf5.c:884).

Mimic behaviour replaced: dT is the double Age[source SnapNum] - Age[current] set at inheritance
(src/core/inheritance.c:168; src/core/build_model.c:334, :391-392; src/core/core_properties.yaml:99-108)
and written as the double dT * (UnitTime_in_s / SEC_PER_MEGAYEAR) (generated copy_to_output.inc from
the output_convert at src/core/core_properties.yaml:108, included at src/io/output/util.c:117).
Value check on the base run: at snapshots 63, 32, 23 and 20 some or all written Mimic dT values are
not bit-identical to R0's, and float(float(dT_code) * UnitTime_in_s / SEC_PER_MEGAYEAR) reproduces
every distinct R0 dT value at snapshots 63, 37, 32 and 23.

What the patch changes: after the generated copy in prepare_halo_for_output (src/io/output/util.c),
a non-sentinel dT is written as (double)(float)((double)(float)g->dT * UnitTime_in_s /
SEC_PER_MEGAYEAR). The persisted dT and every evolution quantity are unchanged; the output dataset
stays float64.

Reading for i02: yes, it would change sage16's and halos-only's written dT (both write the core dT
through the same function), at the float-rounding level, and nothing else in their output.

diff --git a/src/io/output/util.c b/src/io/output/util.c
index 45937fbc..6faa1324 100644
--- a/src/io/output/util.c
+++ b/src/io/output/util.c
@@ -115,4 +115,9 @@ void prepare_halo_for_output(struct HaloInputView view, const struct Halo *g,
 /* AUTO-GENERATED: Copy all properties from struct Halo to struct HaloOutput */
 /* Includes automatic unit conversion for dT (seconds → Myr) with sentinel preservation */
 #include "../../include/generated/copy_to_output.inc"
+  /* x01 (c): SAGE26 writes dT from its float member, g->dT * UnitTime_in_s / SEC_PER_MEGAYEAR,
+   * into a float buffer (R/src/core_allvars.h:123, R/src/io/save_gals_hdf5.c:884) */
+  if (g->dT != -1.0) {
+    o->dT = (double)(float)((double)(float)g->dT * MimicConfig.UnitTime_in_s / SEC_PER_MEGAYEAR);
+  }
 }
